omaach gadh gadh bain ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਰੋਮਾਚਿਤ ਹੋਣ ਕਰ ਕੇ (ਉਸ ਦੇ) ਬੋਲ ਗਦ ਗਦ ਹੋ ਗਏ ਸਨ।"}}},{"verse_id":102043,"page_no":637,"line_no":102043,"gurmukhi":"ਦਿਨ ਤੇ ਭਈ ਜਨੁ ਰੈਨ ॥੨੬॥","translit_en":"dhin te bhiee jan rain ||26||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"She was filled with anxiety on hearing these words and she felt that the day had changed into night.26."},"pu":{"ss":"(ਉਸ ਲਈ) ਦਿਨ ਨੂੰ ਹੀ ਰਾਤ ਹੋ ਗਈ ਸੀ ॥੨੬॥"}}},{"verse_id":102044,"page_no":637,"line_no":102044,"gurmukhi":"ਰੋਮਾਚਿ ਬਿਕਲ ਸਰੀਰ ॥","translit_en":"romaach bikal sareer ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"(ਉਸ ਦਾ) ਸ਼ਰੀਰ ਰੋਮਾਚਿਤ ਅਤੇ ਵਿਆਕੁਲ ਹੋ ਗਿਆ।"}}},{"verse_id":102045,"page_no":637,"line_no":102045,"gurmukhi":"ਤਨ ਕੋਪ ਮਾਨ ਅਧੀਰ ॥","translit_en":"tan kop maan adheer ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਅਧੀਰ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਸ਼ਰੀਰ ਕ੍ਰੋਧਵਾਨ ਹੋ ਗਿਆ।"}}},{"verse_id":102046,"page_no":637,"line_no":102046,"gurmukhi":"ਫਰਕੰਤ ਉਸਟਰੁ ਨੈਨ ॥","translit_en":"faraka(n)t usaTar nain ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਉਸ ਦੀਆਂ ਅੱਖਾ ਅਤੇ ਹੋਂਠ ਫਰਕਦੇ ਸਨ"}}},{"verse_id":102047,"page_no":637,"line_no":102047,"gurmukhi":"ਬਿਨੁ ਬੁਧ ਬੋਲਤ ਬੈਨ ॥੨੭॥","translit_en":"bin budh bolat bain ||27||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"Her body was agitated with anxiety and she getting enraged, became impatient, lips and eyes quivered and she lamented.27."},"pu":{"ss":"ਅਤੇ ਬੁੱਧੀ ਤੋਂ ਬਿਨਾ ਬਚਨ ਬੋਲਦੀ ਸੀ ॥੨੭॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":9326,"next":9328}}